## Object 31. Carried name: "Dead rat.". Words: LEASH, RAT.
## Its line changes with state: once fed it is "There is a dead rat here.". Phase 4.

create the rat
  a thing, portable
  in the North-South Room
  states: hungry, dead

  phrase present while not the player holds the rat:
    There is a hungry rat here.

## Object 32. Carried name: "Cat on leash.". Words: CAT.
## Its line changes with state: once the rat is dead it is "there is a hungry cat here.". Phase 4.

create the cat
  a thing, portable
  in the Room 83
  states: aloof, hungry, fed

  phrase present while not the player holds the cat:
    There is a cat here.

